@startuml 捕获控制器设计状态图
' 冉昕霖 · 第二阶段设计 · CaptureController 的请求与恢复状态
' 40101 不进入本状态图：由 ApiClient 回调入口清会话并跳登录（见 design.txt 4.4）
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #F7FAFC
  BorderColor #6F97B8
  FontColor #1F2A37
  ArrowColor #5B6B7C
}

state "空闲\nIDLE" as Idle
state "取题中\nLOADING" as Loading
state "待作答\nREADY" as Ready
state "提交中\nSUBMITTING" as Submitting
state "结果待确认\nUNKNOWN" as Unknown
state "已捕获\nCAPTURED" as Captured
state "已过期\nEXPIRED" as Expired
state "取题失败\nFAILED" as Failed

[*] --> Idle : 创建控制器
Idle --> Loading : load(spawnId) / state=loading
Loading --> Ready : challenge 成功 / 保存 ChallengeView
Loading --> Failed : ApiFailure / 保存失败原因
Failed --> Loading : retry() / 重新取题

Ready --> Submitting : submit(optionId)\n[!sending] / requestId=newId()、state=submitting
Submitting --> Captured : result=CORRECT\n且 captureRecordId 非空 / 刷新概览
Submitting --> Ready : result=WRONG / 记录答错，允许新 requestId
Submitting --> Unknown : timeout | network / state=unknown
Submitting --> Expired : 41001 / 提示重新遭遇
Submitting --> Ready : 40001 | 40902 / 显示错误，可重试

Unknown : entry / 调用 status(challengeId)
Unknown --> Captured : status=CAPTURED
Unknown --> Submitting : status=OPEN 且原内容已知\n用原 requestId 重试
Unknown --> Ready : status=OPEN 且内容不可恢复\n按新作答处理
Unknown --> Expired : status=EXPIRED
Unknown --> Unknown : 查询失败 / 保留 requestId 与 optionId

Captured : entry / collectionApi.summary()
Captured --> [*] : 页面返回后 dispose()
Expired --> [*] : 页面返回后 dispose()

note right of Submitting
  sending 标志是界面保护，不是幂等保证：
  真正的幂等由 requestId + 服务端唯一约束保证。
end note

note bottom of Unknown
  retry 只允许复用原 requestId + 原 optionId；
  用户重新选择选项时必须 newId()。
  40101 由 ApiClient 统一回调入口处理。
end note
@enduml
